# The extracted CC20 equation-(115) table

The published CC20 angle and coefficient tables behind equations
(114)--(115), stored as exact rationals with their provenance chain:

* angles: https://www.dropbox.com/s/kjmra7t9ejet1pw/rangles5000.docx?dl=0
  sha256 = `0aab652b2187f766af19ba07264a5c02da7b62b40e0b2aaa14773b06460f1ed5`
* coefficients: https://www.dropbox.com/s/e2bswzrh3tps00h/coefficients.docx?dl=0
